{"4887490": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Axis Flip", "steam_appid": 4887490, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4960300], "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity answers to you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axis Flip is an arena combat game where up to 8 players can shoot, stomp or cast their way to victory, all while having gravity itself bend to their whim.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887490/extras/37691475b4de3558eb324c3b8b6cbde2.poster.avif?t=1787598987\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887490/extras/37691475b4de3558eb324c3b8b6cbde2.webm?t=1787598987\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4887490/extras/37691475b4de3558eb324c3b8b6cbde2.mp4?t=1787598987\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different ways to play</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up with your friends in Team Deathmatch, outrun and outmaneuver the enemy in Capture the Flag, or if playing nice isn't your thing; have an all out brawl for supremacy in Free-For-All.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Choose your identity</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With 5 different playable characters at launch; all with their own unique playstyles to master, various spells to cast during the match, and four different directions to fight in, every match will be unique and keep you on your toes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Master the Axis. Own the arena. Adapt or Die.</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gravity answers to you</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Axis Flip is an arena combat game where up to 8 players can shoot, stomp or cast their way t